      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/krayden006/{size}/2414_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-30T19:02:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"andon\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/c77e96/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> andon:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Interested to see if <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/users/krayden006\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" title=\"View user profile.\">Krayden006</a> has similar issues.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>No, all my cards where there as far as I can tell. &nbsp;The starting decks for each ship were green faced with an orange back. &nbsp;Each opposition ship had a red deck + 9 red mission cards. &nbsp;Had a stack of blue/orange sector cards. &nbsp;Sucks if you're missing any, but the &gt;G folks have always been good about taking care of their customers. &nbsp;I'm sure they'll have it fixed in no time.</p>",
